Register the IMAS-MUSCLE3 actors as an importable yMMSL module, so workflows can
say

    imports:
    - from imas_muscle3 import implementation source_component

instead of repeating an executable/args block per actor.

This is upstream commit 8e7102d ("Register imas-muscle3 actors as importable
ymmsl modules", branch feature/ymmsl-path-entrypoints), rebased onto develop and
extended:

 * That branch was cut on 2026-05-19 and exposes only the six actors that
   existed then. develop has since added iterator_component,
   passthrough_component and recorder_component -- all three used by PDS
   workflows -- so ACTORS here lists all eight. visualization_component is gone:
   upstream removed it in favour of the muscle3-dashboard (PR #63).
 * Its imas_muscle3/utils.py hunk is dropped: it added a try/except fallback for
   importing SettingValue, which develop already solved properly with
   `from ymmsl.v0_2 import ...`.

Requires ymmsl >= 0.16 for the "ymmsl.module" entry point group; MUSCLE3 0.10.0
ships 0.17.0.

Drop this patch once the branch is merged and released.
author: Yannick de Jong (ITER PDS), from upstream commit 8e7102d by Maarten Sebregts
diff --git a/imas_muscle3/actors/__init__.py b/imas_muscle3/actors/__init__.py
index e69de29..dc6a3eb 100644
--- a/imas_muscle3/actors/__init__.py
+++ b/imas_muscle3/actors/__init__.py
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+import sys
+
+
+ACTORS = f"""
+ymmsl_version: v0.2
+description: yMMSL configuration for actors exposed by IMAS-MUSCLE3.
+programs:
+  accumulator_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.accumulator_component
+  iterator_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.iterator_component
+  olc_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.olc_component
+  passthrough_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.passthrough_component
+  recorder_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.recorder_component
+  sink_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.sink_component
+  sink_source_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.sink_source_component
+  source_component:
+    executable: {sys.executable}
+    args: -u -m imas_muscle3.actors.source_component
+"""
+"""yMMSL configuration for all actors exposed by IMAS-MUSCLE3."""
diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 81e3633..91baf70 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -95,6 +95,9 @@ linting = [
 [project.urls]
 homepage = "https://github.com/iterorganization/IMAS-MUSCLE3"
 
+[project.entry-points."ymmsl.module"]
+imas_muscle3 = "imas_muscle3.actors:ACTORS"
+
 [tool.setuptools.packages.find]
 where = ["."]
